# Mandatory Engineering System Rule

This repository follows Engineering System 1.2.1 at baseline 540d00edd438f6656fb865902bd295126265bd4f.

Always read:
1. @AGENTS.md
2. @.engineering/project.yaml

Read only when relevant:
3. @.engineering/tests.yaml for implementation/debugging/testing
4. @.engineering/release.yaml for release/version/artifact work
5. only the relevant product specification/ADR/runbook/Engineering System standard

Then:
- identify the change class and affected domains/contracts/security/operations
- make the smallest correct change
- run the cheapest affected deterministic tests first
- keep ordinary PR validation fast
- do not duplicate equivalent native/shared CI
- do not run `./tests/run-all.sh` as an ordinary PR gate
- do not start expensive release qualification while a blocking deterministic regression exists
- never weaken a valid test merely to obtain PASS
- never report unexecuted, skipped, blocked, or historical evidence as current PASS
- never reuse release qualification evidence from another source HEAD
